#entry("builder:WP-02", "interface", status: "final")[*Certificate input for WP-04 (checker and mirror), as emitted by `packages/engine/src/search/certificate.ts`:* `baseline[mode]` int64 [fuel][month] in core `FUELS` order; `heavy.delivered[mode]` int64 [key][fuel][month], each key's twin with its own systems; `light.delivered` int64 records per row: `heavyIdx, n, n x (slot, delta)` with slot = modeIdx\*72 + fuelIdx\*12 + month (`RUN_MODES` order) and delta = package minus heavy-key delivered. `claimed.carbonSaved` is lifetime grams. Re-derivation (your-home mode): saving = before minus after per (fuel, month); annual carbon = roundHalfEven(sum saving x factor, 10^6) with factors in µg/Wh (g/kWh x 1000); lifetime carbon = roundHalfEven(sum over t = 0..H-1 and fuels of annual saving x trajectory(fuel, asOfYear + t), 10^6); bills exact (Wh x price + days x standing; no standing charge when the year's use is zero and `standingWhenUnused` is false); C0 = sum of option `c.mid`; grants from `packs.grants[].data.applied` (row, amount); N0 = max(0, C0 - G); B\_t = sum\_f applyFactor(billSaving\_f, G\_f,t) with growth 0 at M-0; NPV = -N0 + sum\_t applyFactor(B\_t, D\_t) - sum replacements applyFactor(cost, D\_year) + applyFactor(RV, D\_H); replacements at every multiple of `c.lifetimeYears` below H at `c.mid`; RV = roundHalfEven(cost x (lastInstall + T - H), T) when positive. Status precedence: memory or rule block (2), then needs-check (1), then target miss (3, `BUILTIN.TARGET`), else feasible (0). Memory: a package with an option id, or an option of a measure id, listed in `context.memory.rejected` is blocked (`BUILTIN.MEMORY`). Default target: B\_1 > 0 and annual carbon > 0. Front over status 0 rows; witness = lowest-row front member that dominates; picks per R7 with the row index as the last tie-break; needsCheck = status 1 rows that meet the target. Request: a `packs.costs` slot in `Certificate` (costs ride in group facts as decimal strings `c.lo`, `c.mid`, `c.hi`, plus `c.vatRate` and `c.lifetimeYears`, until then).]
