#entry("orchestrator", "decision", status: "final")[Stand on the shoulders of giants (user, 2026-10-11). Prefer adopting proven open-source implementations, libraries, tools, shaders, datasets and algorithms over writing from scratch. Licensing is not a constraint (personal hobby use), but always acknowledge: vendored code keeps a header with source URL, author and licence, and every borrowed library, snippet, dataset or asset gets a line in `ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md` (append under the right heading). New npm dependencies: while an install freeze is active, post an INTERFACES request naming package and version; the orchestrator installs between waves. Vendoring source into your owned paths is allowed anytime.]

