#entry("steward:WP-00", "handoff", status: "done")[*Steward pass.* Answered every open request to WP-00 (see Interfaces). Refreshed the WP-02 results fixture for the real spec hash (`pnpm --filter @ibasho/engine gen:results`). Filled in `ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md`: libraries, ported algorithms, data sources, assets and ideas.]
#entry("steward:WP-00", "handoff", status: "done")[*SPEC 14 contracts landed* in `@ibasho/core`: `maintenance` kind and `MaintenancePlugin`, `DoNothingRequest`/`DoNothingResult`, `Negative`/`NegativesByPackage`, `SearchResult.negatives?`, optional `EngineApi.doNothing?` and `negatives?`, `OwnerCtx.escalation?` and `counterfactual?`. See the Interfaces entry. Core tests 140 pass; typecheck of core and its 22 dependants passes. Not done here: decay models (WP-01), the run itself (WP-02), the fourth line (WP-08), no zod schema for `DoNothingRequest` yet (add when a wire boundary such as MCP needs it).]
#entry("builder:WP-07", "handoff", status: "done")[*Scene, M-A slice.* What exists: the stage (Washi and Yoru still life, SVG fallback and pencil), procedural house from the twin, heat-flow motes, thermal lens, zone tints, roof lift, picking, `a11y-scene` outline, quality ladder, and now `HouseStage` (see Interfaces) and the `home-uk` ui half (`measure-ui` for all 16 measure ids, archetype thumbnails for all 9 built forms). Look fixes: gables are plaster on the inside, so the far wall of the cutaway reads as a room; the stage paper grain is lighter (16 fibres, lower opacity). Tests: `@ibasho/scene` 10 files, 59 passed (new: cutaway composition, house build invariants, `HouseStage` defaults); `@ibasho/pack-home-uk` 4 files, 30 passed (new `test/ui`, 7). Typecheck green on both; Biome, dependency-cruiser and `tools/lint` clean on owned paths. Not built yet: M-B layers (ghost, noise rings, fold assembly, split, miniatures), people, `packs/home-in/src/ui` (T3). G7 frame rate on Iris Xe still to be recorded.]

#entry("builder:WP-04", "handoff", status: "done")[*Checker gaps from M-0 closed.* Lean `proofs/Ibasho/Check/**`: `money.bills` (`chkBills`), `score.recompute` (`chkScore`, exact rationals over `Ibasho.Spec.V2.Score`, front and picks must be scored) and `memory.completed` (`memoryExcluded = rejected ++ completed`). `Valid` gains `bills`, `score` (each claimed sub, group and total is the spec value, so in 0 to 100) and `completedNeverOffered`; `check_sound` still proved, no `sorry`; the audit passes for 25 theorems and all 794 checker declarations. `score.recompute` is skipped only when the certificate claims no score. `ibasho-gen --check` clean (6 files, same `SPEC_HASH`). Mirror `packages/verify/src/mirror/{check,score}.ts` in parity; `emit` adds `claimed.bills` and, given indicators, `claimed.score` (`scoreClaim`). Fixtures `packages/fixtures/src/certs`: golden (now with bills) and new `gh1-m0.scored.cert.json` exit 0; new mutants `completed-in-front` (`feas.recompute` row/1), `score-total` (`score.recompute` row/1), `score-unscored-pick` (`score.recompute`). Results: `@ibasho/verify` 130 tests pass (52 parity cases, Lean and mirror agree on all), `tools/verify` 8 of 8 agree, typecheck and Biome clean on WP-04 paths. PLACEHOLDER: score indicators in the scored fixture are synthetic; real ones come from WP-02.]
#entry("builder:WP-08", "handoff", status: "done")[*M-A shell, onboarding, Reveal.* `/app/start` runs five typed steps (`apps/web/src/start/steps.ts`: time budget guard, refuses any money question, R24). Offline place list and local postcode area read. Every unanswered value is an estimate and marked (AC-G2). `/app/` goes to the last own home, else `/start`. Reveal navigates to `/app/home/:id` with `state.reveal`; `apps/web/src/home/HomeHouse.tsx` mounts `@ibasho/scene` `HouseStage` (washi or yoru from the lantern, pencil while computing, `ROOF_LIFT` once when ready, skipped under reduced motion); no WebGL or a stage error falls back to the SVG house, pencil then ink. Layout zones are one component, `apps/web/src/shell/Zones.tsx` (Niwa, Engawa, Zashiki, Tokonoma). `manifest.ui` now loads `@ibasho/pack-home-uk/ui`; all packs by package name. Stubs: `start/seed.ts` seeds from the GH1 survey twin with every value re-tagged as an estimate until WP-01 `ArchetypePlugin.seed()` exists (only the terrace and Not sure tiles are pickable); all places use London weather; Tune order is fixed until `valueOfInformation`. Tests: `apps/web` 14 passed (3 files, incl. a seeded home reaching the ready state on the real engine worker body), typecheck and Biome clean. For WP-10: DOM hooks `.ib-home[data-state]`, `.ib-house[data-renderer]`, `.ib-choices[data-estimated]`.]
